WEBVTT

00:04.440 --> 00:10.070
I have always believed

00:10.200 --> 00:14.580
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.200 --> 00:14.580
owaranai yume wo nigiri shimete

00:10.200 --> 00:14.580
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.580 --> 00:17.870
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.590 --> 00:31.510
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.590 --> 00:31.510
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.590 --> 00:31.510
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.510 --> 00:34.220
空回りするけど

00:31.510 --> 00:34.220
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.510 --> 00:34.220
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:34.680 --> 00:37.890
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:34.680 --> 00:37.890
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:34.680 --> 00:37.890
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:38.020 --> 00:41.610
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:38.020 --> 00:41.610
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:38.020 --> 00:41.610
You should be yourself.

00:41.730 --> 00:47.450
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:41.730 --> 00:47.450
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:41.730 --> 00:47.450
But you know, a messed up scenario

00:49.110 --> 00:54.620
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:49.110 --> 00:54.620
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:49.110 --> 00:54.620
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:54.620 --> 00:56.120
TRUST MY WAY

00:56.160 --> 01:01.580
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:56.160 --> 01:01.580
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:56.160 --> 01:01.580
The wind, it caresses my cheek.

01:01.840 --> 01:05.260
風と-緒に心地好く

01:01.840 --> 01:05.260
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:01.840 --> 01:05.260
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.260 --> 01:10.140
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.260 --> 01:10.140
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.260 --> 01:10.140
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.260 --> 01:15.770
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.260 --> 01:15.770
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.260 --> 01:15.770
these feelings won't ever change.

01:16.020 --> 01:20.350
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:16.020 --> 01:20.350
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:16.020 --> 01:20.350
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.350 --> 01:23.980
TRUST ME MY WAY

01:33.120 --> 01:36.070
Be thankful; I'm giving you a day of rest!

01:36.280 --> 01:38.990
Now, show me the respect I deserve and get on your kne-

01:40.400 --> 01:42.580
Izumi-san, this is farewell for the time being,

01:42.850 --> 01:44.500
but I swear I'll come back home

01:44.790 --> 01:46.520
to be with you, my most beloved!

01:47.180 --> 01:49.700
I'm sorry for leaving you to watch over the house, Onee-chan.

01:50.290 --> 01:51.610
Well, I'm off!

01:52.330 --> 01:53.290
All right!

01:57.650 --> 02:00.470
It's so quiet...

02:02.170 --> 02:04.440
The house can be this quiet?

02:05.240 --> 02:07.190
This might be the first time this has happened since I got here...

02:08.120 --> 02:10.570
Yoshitaka has been at a cosplay café for a one-piece bathing suit apron special.

02:10.570 --> 02:13.570
I didn't really understand what he was talking about this morning...

02:14.470 --> 02:19.280
Ann-chan said something about preparing for the future and went off to her intensive Dutch program.

02:20.190 --> 02:24.040
And Mitsuki is... I don't really know where, but at any rate, she's out right now.

02:24.860 --> 02:27.050
Which means I'm here by myself, and I'm taking it easy today!

02:27.570 --> 02:31.810
I can't go out because I'm watching the house, but that's fine by me!

02:32.520 --> 02:34.210
Now, time for some rest.

02:35.460 --> 02:40.450
An Unbelievably Short Strike Zone

02:40.730 --> 02:42.230
10 Minutes Later

02:42.930 --> 02:44.640
I-I don't know what to do with myself...

02:46.350 --> 02:49.830
I can't believe that as soon as I finally get some time to myself, I can't do anything!

02:50.280 --> 02:56.790
Well, when I think about it, I've been constantly drawn into these ridiculous ruckuses ever since I got here.

02:57.870 --> 02:59.660
Hmm? A visitor?

03:02.000 --> 03:03.530
Yes, may I ask who's th-

03:07.680 --> 03:08.480
Onee-chan!

03:08.680 --> 03:09.500
Karin?!

03:09.710 --> 03:10.610
Why are you here?!

03:10.810 --> 03:12.370
Dad got hurt.

03:12.700 --> 03:13.430
R-Really?

03:13.590 --> 03:14.980
Dad got... HURT?!

03:15.170 --> 03:15.930
Well, you see...

03:16.420 --> 03:17.180
I'm worried.

03:17.220 --> 03:17.850
I'm worried.

03:17.890 --> 03:18.760
Damn it! I'm worried!

03:18.260 --> 03:23.170
Dad worried about you and Mitsuki too much and got into a car accident.

03:18.930 --> 03:19.990
I'm so worried!

03:23.100 --> 03:24.650
N-No, don't. I beg you!

03:24.140 --> 03:30.020
Mom is busy looking after Dad and told me to have you watch over me here while he's in the hospital.

03:25.190 --> 03:25.730
Not Karin.

03:25.760 --> 03:26.860
Anyone but Karin!

03:27.520 --> 03:29.690
Don't send Karin to a place like that!

03:31.220 --> 03:33.420
That's Mom for you.

03:34.120 --> 03:36.360
So please look after me, all right, Onee-chan?

03:36.680 --> 03:37.450
N-No way!

03:37.530 --> 03:38.700
Absolutely no way!

03:39.040 --> 03:42.380
There's no way I can take a cute girl like you

03:42.660 --> 03:45.690
into a house where a moron with an
unbelievably short strike zone lives, Karin!

03:45.910 --> 03:46.690
So I can't stay here?

03:47.500 --> 03:48.210
Karin...

03:48.380 --> 03:48.840
That's right.

03:49.630 --> 03:50.480
If we do it now...

03:53.260 --> 03:56.210
I can't watch after you here.

03:56.830 --> 03:57.680
Really?

03:58.050 --> 03:58.640
But you know...

03:59.410 --> 04:03.940
You and I are the only ones at this house today, so I'll play with you as much as you want!

04:04.260 --> 04:06.450
In return, you go home when we're done playing.

04:06.640 --> 04:07.270
All right?

04:07.590 --> 04:08.100
Yeah!

04:09.050 --> 04:10.370
I love you, Onee-chan!

04:09.920 --> 04:10.680
Hey now!

04:12.540 --> 04:14.320
This is Onee-chan's room.

04:14.780 --> 04:15.280
It's spacious.

04:15.570 --> 04:16.170
It's huge!

04:16.700 --> 04:18.940
Well, I'm not treated too poorly.

04:19.320 --> 04:21.200
The problem is just my employer.

04:21.670 --> 04:23.760
That reminds me, where's Mitsuki-oneechan?

04:24.110 --> 04:26.620
I'm sorry, but Mitsuki isn't here today.

04:27.030 --> 04:27.750
I see.

04:28.040 --> 04:28.740
Thats too bad.

04:28.970 --> 04:29.960
Then what about Pochi?

04:30.370 --> 04:31.380
P-Pochi?

04:31.770 --> 04:34.210
Um, well, Pochi is here, but...

04:34.340 --> 04:35.050
Do you want to see him?

04:35.130 --> 04:35.700
Yeah!

04:36.250 --> 04:37.090
I guess I don't have a choice.

04:37.590 --> 04:38.150
Here, let's go!

04:46.870 --> 04:49.490
I didn't really want to come here, but...

04:50.050 --> 04:52.020
I have to protect everyone!

04:51.410 --> 04:51.980
Pochi!

04:52.360 --> 04:52.960
I'm coming in!

04:52.650 --> 04:53.290
I'm going to transform!

04:54.030 --> 04:56.010
Magical Love Ch-

04:56.010 --> 04:58.480
According to interviews with those involved, the turnabout that day was...

04:58.560 --> 05:00.840
It's fine. Just leave it the way it is for now.

05:01.120 --> 05:02.560
More importantly, you have a visitor!

05:04.010 --> 05:05.120
Pochi!

05:08.930 --> 05:09.570
Pochi!

05:11.270 --> 05:15.320
Really, you've been perfectly fine with Pochi for as long as I can remember, Karin.

05:15.980 --> 05:16.460
Yeah!

05:16.630 --> 05:17.980
I love Pochi!

05:18.920 --> 05:21.520
All right, Pochi, let's go mansion exploring!

05:23.510 --> 05:24.010
Huh?

05:25.200 --> 05:26.210
W-Wait!

05:26.340 --> 05:27.520
Giddyup!

05:38.440 --> 05:39.950
It's so big and spacious!

05:40.070 --> 05:41.860
And there are so many rooms!

05:50.640 --> 05:53.100
That was close; my debt almost increased some more!

05:53.260 --> 05:54.460
Wow!

05:55.020 --> 05:56.690
Onee-chan, nice catch!

06:00.480 --> 06:02.180
Karin, why don't we go outside?

06:02.550 --> 06:04.380
It's pretty dangerous here.

06:04.470 --> 06:05.750
All right, Onee-chan.

06:08.380 --> 06:10.980
It looks like some monster went on a rampage here.

06:13.300 --> 06:16.140
Maybe there are some scary monsters around here...

06:17.890 --> 06:19.570
Yeah, I'll be fine if Pochi is here!

06:24.610 --> 06:25.870
Onee-chan, you're incredible!

06:26.720 --> 06:30.750
Th-This place is kind of dangerous because it's falling apart, so don't get too close!

06:30.960 --> 06:31.330
All right!

06:31.660 --> 06:33.810
Then take me somewhere else, Pochi.

06:39.440 --> 06:42.010
So... heavy...

06:46.230 --> 06:47.560
I thought I was going to die.

06:48.060 --> 06:49.190
That's right... Where's Karin?

06:52.200 --> 06:54.210
Wow, there are so many koi!

06:54.560 --> 06:55.610
Wooow!

06:56.870 --> 06:58.020
Don't do it, Pochi!

06:58.110 --> 07:01.090
Don't increase my debt any further!

07:01.880 --> 07:03.990
Pochi, don't eat the koi!

07:06.530 --> 07:07.540
Bad boy!

07:07.540 --> 07:08.640
Onee-chan, look out!

07:22.680 --> 07:23.410
What is it?

07:23.710 --> 07:24.510
This is fun!

07:25.330 --> 07:26.060
I guess you're right.

07:26.850 --> 07:27.550
Here!

07:28.770 --> 07:30.250
Now you've done it!

07:33.330 --> 07:34.440
Take this, and this, and this!

07:35.170 --> 07:37.700
If you peek...

07:35.170 --> 07:37.700
Izumi's Room

07:37.960 --> 07:41.190
Let's see if we can find some clothes you might be able to wear, Karin.

07:41.710 --> 07:43.570
Ah, this looks pretty nice!

07:44.120 --> 07:44.820
Does it look good?

07:45.680 --> 07:46.780
Yeah, it really does!

07:47.240 --> 07:49.180
You look so cute wearing that!

07:50.120 --> 07:53.120
Wait. I'm happy that my little sister is wearing this?

07:53.580 --> 07:54.830
What am I, Yoshitaka?!

07:56.460 --> 07:57.320
Now we match!

07:57.470 --> 07:58.710
Y-Yeah, you're right!

08:00.720 --> 08:03.400
Why are there some in children sizes too?

08:03.570 --> 08:04.970
Jeez, he's prepared for anything.

08:06.180 --> 08:07.990
I've had enough of this life.

08:08.180 --> 08:09.350
Because of your debt?

08:10.550 --> 08:12.080
H-How did you now about...

08:12.410 --> 08:15.860
Well, Onee-chan, you've been talking about your debt the whole time.

08:15.860 --> 08:17.370
Oh, yeah...

08:17.370 --> 08:20.250
Onee-chan, should I lend you my allowance?

08:20.710 --> 08:21.650
Thank you.

08:21.900 --> 08:23.510
I'm happy knowing that you're willing to help.

08:24.070 --> 08:25.030
But it's all right.

08:25.280 --> 08:29.070
I have a way to pay off my whole de- Well, maybe I do, and maybe I don't.

08:29.460 --> 08:30.530
Do you or do you not?

08:30.940 --> 08:33.410
Ah, well, the truth is...

08:36.840 --> 08:37.830
Amazing!

08:38.250 --> 08:40.040
Onee-chan, you're going to be an idol?

08:40.170 --> 08:41.520
Are you going to sing on TV?

08:41.710 --> 08:42.710
Wow, wow!

08:42.710 --> 08:43.930
You're so cool!

08:44.180 --> 08:47.920
Now, Karin, I haven't exactly decided that I'm going to be one yet.

08:48.050 --> 08:51.450
And besides, I don't think I'll be the kind who appears on TV...

08:51.600 --> 08:52.260
Why not?

08:52.540 --> 08:54.820
If you become an idol, you can repay the money, right?

08:55.430 --> 08:56.540
Why won't you do it?

08:57.050 --> 08:58.330
W-Well...

09:00.920 --> 09:03.680
I bet it's just a sinkhole that will increase your debt even more.

09:03.770 --> 09:04.480
Shut up!

09:08.150 --> 09:11.900
Just as I though, there's no way I could ever be an idol.

09:12.020 --> 09:13.160
That's not true at all!

09:14.560 --> 09:17.260
You're really cute when you wear those clothes, Onee-chan!

09:18.160 --> 09:19.780
An idol in maid outfits, huh?

09:20.030 --> 09:23.150
I'm glad you're encouraging me, but that's a little bit...

09:23.660 --> 09:24.400
I see.

09:24.830 --> 09:28.950
But I'd be happy if you became an idol, Onee-chan.

09:29.010 --> 09:29.470
Huh?

09:30.160 --> 09:34.030
If you do, I can see my happy Onee-chan whenever I want!

09:34.980 --> 09:35.750
Karin...

09:41.420 --> 09:47.170
If I were to do well as an idol, I could repay my debt and Karin would be happy.

09:51.250 --> 09:55.700
If that happened, I wouldn't cause her any more grief.

10:13.640 --> 10:14.550
Yoshitaka!

10:14.680 --> 10:15.270
Everyone!

10:16.300 --> 10:18.000
Why are they home already?

10:19.670 --> 10:20.600
I'm sorry, Karin!

10:20.730 --> 10:23.220
The situation has changed, you'll have to go home n-

10:26.120 --> 10:26.900
Karin?

10:41.400 --> 10:43.460
Y-You're all early!

10:43.630 --> 10:45.700
Weren't you going to be home late tonight?

10:46.480 --> 10:50.830
Some one-piece swimsuit fanatics forced their way in, so they called it off.

10:51.110 --> 10:54.080
You have to be 16 to get married in Holland, too.

10:54.890 --> 10:56.550
He understood what I was talking about!

10:56.720 --> 10:58.540
All the preparations are complete!

10:58.670 --> 10:59.820
R-Really?

10:59.820 --> 11:00.990
O-Oh.

11:00.990 --> 11:02.570
That really was such a waste of time.

11:02.880 --> 11:04.190
Izumi, make some coffee.

11:05.280 --> 11:08.540
WHY DON'T YOU SHUT UP AND GO OUT AND HAVE MORE FUN?!

11:11.250 --> 11:13.660
Izumi-san is even wilder than normal today!

11:13.670 --> 11:14.200
Fabulous!

11:14.560 --> 11:16.410
Izumi-saaaan!

11:20.100 --> 11:22.080
A long red hair...

11:22.250 --> 11:23.300
Could it be?

11:23.890 --> 11:25.350
What the hell did I do?!

11:26.260 --> 11:28.910
Are you all right, Master?

11:28.110 --> 11:30.330
That bitch, she's really out of control!

11:30.720 --> 11:33.120
I'm going to punish her with a Nakabayashi family torture technique, The Unbearably Painful 1000-Year-Long Murder!

11:34.260 --> 11:36.860
I suppose I can let events unfold by themselves every once and a while...

11:39.010 --> 11:40.770
Where did you go, Karin?

11:41.450 --> 11:42.040
There she is!

11:42.170 --> 11:43.600
Wait up, Karin!

11:44.400 --> 11:45.100
Izumi!

11:45.650 --> 11:46.890
I will make this your gra-

11:47.060 --> 11:48.060
YOU'RE IN THE WAY!

11:48.550 --> 11:49.590
Karin!

11:49.660 --> 11:50.670
Be glad, Izumi.

11:50.980 --> 11:53.820
You are indeed suited to be the main participant in tonight's Black Mass!

11:56.520 --> 11:57.030
Karin!

11:57.060 --> 11:57.950
Pochi, wait!

11:58.680 --> 12:00.330
Hi, Onee-chan!

12:00.750 --> 12:02.630
How can you be so carefree?

12:02.800 --> 12:04.010
Bye-bye, Onee-chan!

12:04.420 --> 12:05.990
Hey, hold it!

12:07.780 --> 12:09.280
Ah, I found you, Izumi-san!

12:09.490 --> 12:11.860
Izumi-san, please take me wildly!

12:12.020 --> 12:14.480
I don't have time to humor Anna-chan right now.

12:14.820 --> 12:16.530
Since it's come to this... I'LL IGNORE HER!

12:17.220 --> 12:17.890
I'm so happy!

12:18.010 --> 12:20.800
Izumi-san, you've finally committed to doing it!

12:21.660 --> 12:22.430
Let's do it right now!

12:22.720 --> 12:25.780
I'm even okay with doing it right here!

12:25.920 --> 12:26.510
What are you talking about?!

12:26.860 --> 12:28.720
What do you mean what am I talking about, Izumi-san?

12:27.870 --> 12:28.720
I guess I don't have a choice.

12:29.600 --> 12:30.440
Here, Anna-chan!

12:30.470 --> 12:32.230
It's my warm bra!

12:35.460 --> 12:39.490
I could never wear a bra in these clothes to begin with, but I'm glad I had one prepared!

12:40.620 --> 12:41.660
Karin!

12:42.040 --> 12:43.070
I lost her!

12:47.320 --> 12:49.230
Pochi, playing tag is so much fun!

12:51.220 --> 12:54.720
If we stay hidden in Onee-chan's room, there's no way we'll be found!

12:55.170 --> 12:56.710
Let's see, I think it was...

12:58.950 --> 13:00.780
Having as much fun as you want?

13:01.140 --> 13:02.020
Yeah, that's it!

13:02.510 --> 13:03.100
Huh?

13:03.100 --> 13:04.300
Mitsuki-oneechan!

13:05.040 --> 13:06.390
I thought it was you, Karin!

13:06.520 --> 13:08.290
But why in the world are you here today?

13:08.500 --> 13:09.940
Yeah, well, you see...

13:11.900 --> 13:12.690
I see.

13:12.690 --> 13:15.230
So that's why Onee-chan was acting so crazy.

13:15.550 --> 13:18.300
Should I not have come at all?

13:19.060 --> 13:19.860
That's not it!

13:20.070 --> 13:22.990
There's no way Onee-chan wouldn't want to see you!

13:22.990 --> 13:24.000
Yeah...

13:24.000 --> 13:24.370
That's right.

13:24.660 --> 13:27.380
So don't hold back. Play to your heart's content!

13:30.260 --> 13:33.750
It looks like you've made me get serious, Izumi!

13:34.840 --> 13:39.500
I'll thoroughly beat the relationship of power between master and his maid into y-

13:40.590 --> 13:43.010
Ah, Onii-chan, are you all right?

13:46.230 --> 13:48.290
Wh-Who in the world is this angel?

13:49.140 --> 13:50.020
That's it!

13:50.150 --> 13:51.060
I've got it!

13:51.390 --> 13:54.790
At last, a young girl maid who will call me "Onii-chan" has descended from the heavens!

13:54.980 --> 13:56.460
As if that would happen!

13:59.810 --> 14:01.070
Ah, Izumi-oneechan!

14:01.740 --> 14:02.920
It guess you found me.

14:04.960 --> 14:06.410
You worthless excuse for a human!

14:06.540 --> 14:09.250
I won't let you do as you please with Karin!

14:09.910 --> 14:12.690
I thought you were unusually tense.

14:12.860 --> 14:13.540
I see.

14:13.590 --> 14:14.920
So you had another younger sister?

14:15.190 --> 14:16.000
Relax.

14:16.170 --> 14:17.960
I'll be sure to make her one of my maids, too...

14:19.350 --> 14:22.320
I'm surprised you have the nerve to say that!

14:24.010 --> 14:24.720
Sure this is all right?

14:25.100 --> 14:26.910
You took your eyes off your precious little sister.

14:27.220 --> 14:28.180
Look next to you!

14:28.600 --> 14:29.830
She's gone!

14:32.150 --> 14:33.030
Yoshitaka!

14:33.220 --> 14:35.040
The young girl maid is all mine!

14:36.420 --> 14:37.670
Hold it right there!

14:38.370 --> 14:39.150
What's wrong?

14:39.780 --> 14:42.070
You certainly are working on improving your wild side today!

14:42.500 --> 14:44.770
As for earlier, thanks for the treat!

14:44.890 --> 14:45.330
Anna-chan!

14:45.620 --> 14:48.630
Right now, my little sister Karin is with Pochi!

14:48.990 --> 14:49.330
Ah?

14:49.790 --> 14:52.280
You were hiding another younger sister, Izumi-san?

14:52.960 --> 14:55.930
If you help me keep her safe from Yoshitaka,

14:56.270 --> 14:58.000
I'll sleep with your tonight!

14:58.910 --> 15:00.300
I'll sleep with your tonight!

15:00.670 --> 15:02.130
I'll sleep with your tonight!

15:02.260 --> 15:03.730
I'll sleep with your tonight!

15:06.410 --> 15:07.770
Then I'll absolutely help you!

15:12.550 --> 15:14.810
There are so many stuffed toys and dolls!

15:14.980 --> 15:15.600
They're so cute!

15:16.750 --> 15:18.070
Ah, there's even dolls of Onee-chan!

15:19.770 --> 15:21.530
This room is full of toys!

15:22.150 --> 15:23.320
It's like a toy store!

15:24.810 --> 15:25.740
Western clothes!

15:25.990 --> 15:26.660
Wow!

15:26.910 --> 15:28.090
It's like something our of a dream!

15:32.460 --> 15:33.380
Last stop!

15:36.990 --> 15:38.280
Hey, Karin-chan.

15:38.560 --> 15:40.140
Ah, the Onii-chan from earlier!

15:41.390 --> 15:42.940
Do you like this mansion?

15:43.510 --> 15:44.020
Yeah!

15:44.110 --> 15:45.110
I'm glad to hear that!

15:45.320 --> 15:48.160
Then if you want, you can stay in this mansion from now o-

15:48.270 --> 15:49.640
I won't let you!

15:50.970 --> 15:52.620
Damn. She found me!

15:52.850 --> 15:53.730
Of course I did!

15:52.850 --> 15:56.980
Warning: Sawatari Izumi

15:53.810 --> 15:56.980
There's no way that God would overlook your indiscriminate tendencies!

16:05.620 --> 16:07.440
I'm going to protect Karin!

16:07.640 --> 16:08.320
No!

16:08.490 --> 16:09.740
<i>I'm </i>going to make her my maid!

16:14.210 --> 16:14.910
Certain Victory!

16:14.910 --> 16:17.220
Izumi-san Bra Shooooot!

16:24.410 --> 16:26.400
As if I'd give it to you!

16:28.140 --> 16:29.880
I did it, Izumi-san!

16:30.270 --> 16:31.320
That's unsightly.

16:32.820 --> 16:33.560
Karin?

16:33.890 --> 16:34.910
Karin, you know...

16:35.460 --> 16:36.100
I got it.

16:36.140 --> 16:38.300
I'll go home, all right, Onee-chan?

16:38.690 --> 16:39.390
Huh?

16:39.390 --> 16:42.370
It was a lot of fun being able to play with you today, Onee-chan.

16:42.550 --> 16:45.790
And I'm happy to see that you're doing well.

16:47.070 --> 16:51.620
Onee-chan, you were always fighting with Mom and Dad at our house,

16:51.860 --> 16:55.920
But you really look happy here, and it looks like you have a lot of fun, too!

16:56.900 --> 16:57.600
Karin...

16:58.830 --> 17:03.000
Karin didn't come all the way here just because she was lonely.

17:03.670 --> 17:06.680
She wanted to cheer me up.

17:07.350 --> 17:08.090
Ah, that's right!

17:09.320 --> 17:10.100
Um, let's see.

17:11.640 --> 17:13.720
Here, I found this in your room, Onee-chan.

17:13.800 --> 17:14.410
I'm giving it back to you.

17:15.210 --> 17:16.850
This is a contract.

17:18.000 --> 17:22.000
If you do, I can see my happy Onee-chan whenever I want!

17:25.250 --> 17:26.680
It's all right, Karin.

17:28.040 --> 17:29.930
I'm not going to make you worry anymore.

17:30.250 --> 17:33.660
I'll always show you my happy self.

17:34.210 --> 17:36.280
I'll try being an idol.

17:36.550 --> 17:37.660
Watch me, all right, Karin?

17:38.740 --> 17:39.480
What did you say?

17:40.060 --> 17:41.450
Really, Onee-chan?

17:42.200 --> 17:42.840
Yeah!

17:43.040 --> 17:48.930
Onee-chan will earn lots and lots of money and get a biig house so she can live with you, Karin!

17:49.170 --> 17:50.180
Hey, hey!

17:50.260 --> 17:53.470
I've said this before, but there's no way you're going to succeed!

17:53.700 --> 17:54.390
That's right.

17:54.680 --> 17:59.400
It's true that I haven't had the confidence or determination to become an idol until now.

18:00.790 --> 18:02.140
But I'm different now!

18:02.570 --> 18:07.450
I will become an idol in these clothes that Karin said were so cute!

18:07.760 --> 18:08.490
Yeah!

18:08.570 --> 18:10.000
As a maid idol!

18:10.480 --> 18:12.540
M-Maid idol?!

18:13.060 --> 18:14.080
That's right!

18:14.160 --> 18:16.660
I'm going to go all out serving all of my fans!

18:17.390 --> 18:19.870
Th-This incredible intensity!

18:20.000 --> 18:22.650
Izumi... does she no longer have any regard for her self-respect?

18:23.060 --> 18:26.260
If it's for my little sisters, I'll do anything!

18:26.630 --> 18:27.300
Izumi-san!

18:27.380 --> 18:29.870
You look so wonderful when you're strong and unchained!

18:30.200 --> 18:32.380
Yay! Onee-chan, you're so cool!

18:33.900 --> 18:34.930
You can't!

18:34.970 --> 18:36.140
I won't allow it!

18:36.350 --> 18:37.640
D-Dad!

18:38.230 --> 18:39.430
You can't do it, no matter what you say!

18:39.460 --> 18:41.020
No idol, no house, no alligator!

18:41.720 --> 18:43.160
So you came back, old man?!

18:46.100 --> 18:48.710
Dad, weren't you in the hospital?

18:49.530 --> 18:52.680
I couldn't stay in the hospital when I'm worried about Karin!

18:54.990 --> 18:57.870
K-K-Karin, you're in this outfit too?

18:58.240 --> 18:58.700
I won't forgive you.

18:59.370 --> 19:00.410
I won't forgive you, Yoshitaka!

19:00.510 --> 19:01.900
Um, I did that, actually...

19:03.210 --> 19:03.980
Hey, Dad!

19:07.000 --> 19:08.650
Mom!

19:08.920 --> 19:10.800
I came to get you, Karin.

19:11.070 --> 19:12.550
It's been a while, Izumi!

19:15.940 --> 19:17.340
Oh, my!

19:17.520 --> 19:20.110
You pushed yourself too hard, your wounds got worse, and you collapsed!

19:20.230 --> 19:21.640
Mom, <i>you</i> did that.

19:22.240 --> 19:27.320
It certainly seems that when Karin is in this house, your father can't calm down and rest.

19:27.570 --> 19:29.000
So I'll take her home.

19:29.270 --> 19:29.900
Mom!

19:30.280 --> 19:32.450
Onee-chan said she's going to become an idol!

19:32.560 --> 19:33.580
Don't try to stop me!

19:33.760 --> 19:39.000
I'm going to earn a lot of money and get a house where I can live with Mitsuki, Karin, and Pochi!

19:39.590 --> 19:40.580
That's nice.

19:40.700 --> 19:41.580
Do your best!

19:42.770 --> 19:44.460
Wait a little while longer.

19:44.540 --> 19:46.760
I'll be happy and do my best!

19:47.050 --> 19:47.700
Right!

19:48.490 --> 19:51.690
To be honest... How did you trick Izumi into doing this?

19:51.840 --> 19:55.020
I just watched today, so it must have been Karin!

19:56.600 --> 19:58.150
She really is a thorough schemer!

19:58.610 --> 20:01.120
Izumi will be able to live that lifestyle vigorously!

20:04.090 --> 20:06.060
Bye, everyone!

20:06.350 --> 20:07.770
I'll come here to play again!

20:07.940 --> 20:08.970
Take care of Pochi!

20:09.210 --> 20:10.680
I told you not to come back here!

20:10.840 --> 20:11.910
Come again, all right?

20:14.500 --> 20:15.790
I have a report.

20:15.960 --> 20:19.390
Sawatari Izumi-sama has finally signed her contract.

20:20.110 --> 20:20.960
I see.

20:21.770 --> 20:23.310
How should we proceed?

20:23.480 --> 20:24.500
It's obvious.

20:24.620 --> 20:27.080
Tell her we're shooting for her to become a top idol!

20:27.500 --> 20:28.760
Understood.

20:29.230 --> 20:32.850
The arrangements for the supervising producer have already been taken care of.

20:35.790 --> 20:41.060
Don't think everything will always go as you want, Yoshitaka!

20:45.140 --> 20:46.310
A maid idol?

20:46.520 --> 20:47.100
That's not bad!

20:47.270 --> 20:47.940
Not bad at all!

20:48.120 --> 20:49.480
I have some good ideas for Izumi!

20:49.730 --> 20:50.940
78 points, you know!

20:51.240 --> 20:55.990
But don't forget that<i> I'm </i>the only one you serve!

20:57.660 --> 20:58.410
Izumi-san!

20:58.570 --> 20:59.730
Do you remember your promise?

20:59.900 --> 21:01.760
Ah, um, what was it?

21:02.090 --> 21:05.130
You said if I protected Karin, you'd sleep with me!

21:05.340 --> 21:06.540
Ah, I guess I did!

21:07.040 --> 21:08.130
Well, let's get ready.

21:08.440 --> 21:09.850
First, I'll tie your hands.

21:10.640 --> 21:11.560
Ah, you're doing something like that already?

21:12.000 --> 21:14.970
But I won't object. Please do what you like!

21:15.160 --> 21:16.410
Then comes the blindfold.

21:16.610 --> 21:17.230
Yes!

21:17.880 --> 21:19.390
Now, we'll lie down in bed.

21:20.850 --> 21:23.060
Ah, I will finally be with Izumi-san!

21:23.140 --> 21:25.310
How I've longed for this day!

21:26.930 --> 21:28.140
So, you're pretending to ignore me?

21:28.190 --> 21:30.300
Come on, Izumi-san!

21:30.600 --> 21:31.060
Huh?

21:31.440 --> 21:32.140
Are you listening?

21:33.190 --> 21:33.920
Izumi-san?

21:34.900 --> 21:35.960
Izumi-san?!

21:39.890 --> 21:41.620
Do your best, all right, Onee-chan?

21:41.910 --> 21:43.680
I'll be cheering for you!

21:44.390 --> 21:46.530
Onee-chan's gon do 'er bes...

21:49.500 --> 21:53.610
I didn't think my meeting this afternoon would produce results this soon!

21:54.300 --> 21:56.390
Onee-chan's first job is...

21:57.560 --> 21:58.220
Here!

22:01.300 --> 22:13.230
Izumi's debt from today

22:05.260 --> 22:13.230
Mitsuki's earnings so far

22:09.260 --> 22:13.230
How much Izumi has left before she pays off her debt

22:27.570 --> 22:31.000
見た目の甘さほどは

22:27.570 --> 22:31.000
mitame no amasa hodo ha

22:27.570 --> 22:31.000
They only appear sweet for a moment

22:31.010 --> 22:34.750
儚いとか 弱くもないから

22:31.010 --> 22:34.750
hakanai to ka yowaku mo nai kara

22:31.010 --> 22:34.750
and they're not weak either.

22:34.780 --> 22:39.720
女の子は結構頑丈よ

22:34.780 --> 22:39.720
onnanoko ha kekkou ganjou yo

22:34.780 --> 22:39.720
Girls are pretty stable.

22:41.800 --> 22:45.010
意地っ張り空回りを

22:41.800 --> 22:45.010
ijippari karamawari wo

22:41.800 --> 22:45.010
Because they're stubborn,

22:45.090 --> 22:48.870
楽しめちゃう余裕も大事ネ!

22:45.090 --> 22:48.870
tanoshimechau yoyuu mo daiji ne!

22:45.090 --> 22:48.870
they can enjoy getting nothing done; free time is precious, too.

22:48.880 --> 22:53.600
笑顔にはたっぷりのスパイスが

22:48.880 --> 22:53.600
egao ni ha tappuri no SUPAISU ga

22:48.880 --> 22:53.600
Is there a good deal of spice in that smile?

22:54.300 --> 22:55.930
どうかナ?

22:54.300 --> 22:55.930
dou ka na?

22:54.300 --> 22:55.930
I wonder...

22:56.210 --> 23:02.330
常識など壊す刺激的なヒミツ

22:56.210 --> 23:02.330
joushiki nado kowasu shigekitekina himitsu

22:56.210 --> 23:02.330
The stimulating secret that smashes common sense,

23:02.460 --> 23:09.950
スカートでそっと巧く隠してる

23:02.460 --> 23:09.950
SUKATTO de sotto umaku kakushiteru

23:02.460 --> 23:09.950
is well-concealed within their skirts.

23:10.050 --> 23:16.830
愛情のカタマリでこの気持ち出来てる

23:10.050 --> 23:16.830
aijou no katamari de kono kimochi dekiteru

23:10.050 --> 23:16.830
I have a feeling this can be a mass of love.

23:17.090 --> 23:23.810
キュんとなるシュンカンを夢みていたいから

23:17.090 --> 23:23.810
KYUN to naru shunkan wo yume miteitai kara

23:17.090 --> 23:23.810
Because I want to have dreams of this moment, that will not matter.

23:24.130 --> 23:31.140
愛情のカタマリでオトメは進化する

23:24.130 --> 23:31.140
aijou no katamari de otome ha shinka suru

23:24.130 --> 23:31.140
The maidens grow in a mass of love,

23:31.200 --> 23:38.250
トキメキもカガヤキも抱きしめているから

23:31.200 --> 23:38.250
TOKIMEKI mo kagayaki mo dakishimeteiru kara

23:31.200 --> 23:38.250
because they are embracing their glowing excitement.

23:44.820 --> 23:48.800
After overcoming many trials, Onee-chan appears to have finally broken free!

23:49.160 --> 23:51.940
However, as reality doesn't resolve itself so amicably,

23:52.210 --> 23:54.190
a series of necessary trials appears one after another.

23:54.690 --> 23:58.710
Can Onee-chan overcome the constant interference of Dad, Anna-san, and Master

23:58.990 --> 24:02.600
and reach the light at the end of the tunnel?

24:02.810 --> 24:06.150
Mitsuki, how long are you going to mumble to yourself?

24:06.370 --> 24:07.740
Get to bed; it's late.

24:07.840 --> 24:08.260
All right!

24:08.260 --> 24:13.260
Izumi is Izumi, but Izumi Will No Longer Yield to Anyone

24:08.300 --> 24:10.200
Once I finish this script I'm writing!

24:10.310 --> 24:12.680
Next week is going to be out of control too!
